:false,"text":"As Yukari's cousin, Sae used to hang out with him all the time. However, as the pair grew older, they drifted apart. Now reunited at Platinum, Yukari sees how much Sae has grown up. She's confident and beautiful, but she's developed in some indecent ways as well, and she can't wait to show him those, either."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30121"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/361cfcbe878a9d30ac2b86ad313bc746941fa29ec6b3bb4325f872afd33fa228.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b0ee63294c1a56804b481712fcc83c8d58ff1ce21ccd9271d5d6e9310d756a71.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30122","characterName":"鵠沼 涼","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30122"},"originalCharacterName":"鵠沼 涼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even though she's the youngest of the bunch, Ryou naturally takes charge when it comes to work. This discipline comes from a traditional and strict upbringing. With such a background, though, it's odd that she would work in such a revealing atmosphere, but it seems to have given her plenty of hidden cravings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30122"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e9c7b2d62b2913b22d30baf412c3f7f34ed3a6a0f43bee3fe4f212834b183a9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/51/51767014d5d086144e99d86ff1faf316a4dd96155609778fbffcc52461131c30.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30123","characterName":"柳 ひろみ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30123"},"originalCharacterName":"柳 ひろみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sae's best friend seems like the least likely type of person to work in a bunny uniform. She wears glasses and seems a bit insulated. She especially lacks confidence when it comes to interacting with guys. Fortunately, she has no problems opening up to Yukari!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30123"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4dd87f168f83b1ef727f7a0cdf3cc8bdedda1180e692f66a12567495a4fdf30f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b2574b9f343db5345a68ae44a77133ebe4ffc611d64c648cf030bf127d87c8f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30124","characterName":"長谷 ちまき","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30124"},"originalCharacterName":"長谷 ちまき","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chimaki may look young and immature, and she certainly acts that way, but she is actually the oldest waitress of the bunch. She's certainly not ashamed of that fact, or much of anything else, and is more than happy to act out her kinky perversions with her newest colleague."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30124"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba70e610fe9002afee75ce819376c878ebbc21c1fb0c3804b2b8ffefa7ebbf74.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5cde9df8e9dd64d45cf9b796ec513a839f70baf857f1f590a9f16d54b4ece4b3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30125","characterName":"稲村 明菜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30125"},"originalCharacterName":"稲村 明菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akina is the manager of Platinum. She may seem a bit insane at first. After all, she can't resist jumping on anyone she finds cute, man or woman. Underneath that though, well, she's still a crazed sex machine. Whenever she pops up, prepare for the unexpected."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30125"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e09e6b7dc128d85326748120d87f9286c6fbb241687a9aee2315f4204f94016.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/eeea1851c3c78d12073eeef3eaea47770c67ab5d6c18f1956d93b5b1fb12e1f5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3934","characterName":"春日 まどか","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3934"},"originalCharacterName":"春日 まどか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A bright and kind girl, Madoka is also very confident in herself. She has a great body, naturally, and likes to show it off by wearing skimpy clothes, which makes her job as a bunny girl a perfect fit. Though she's everyone's friend and likes to kid around, she's very serious about Kazuma."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3934"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc5653f2a276fa6c6778ac004ca72c51165620fd6e300d6a52af0efc7fda42ad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e167d7ef5f38477ef411ed30c72b613090d27b47a8c87e114fe30adefca01b2d.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さはら まや","creatorId":"vndb:s2064","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2064","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2064","name":"さはら まや","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1445","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3935","characterName":"萩野 真琴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3935"},"originalCharacterName":"萩野 真琴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Makoto seems kind and gentle, but she possesses a hidden drive. In addition to working as a bunny girl, she's constantly auditioning for acting jobs. Unfortunately, the only jobs she can land are to model scandalous swimwear, thanks to her gigantic breasts. Sometimes she feels her body is a handicap, but maybe Kazuma can help her appreciate her assets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3935"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fcaf73eef5da0e33110821915bc4a9165adad3ffcfcf1c887f2b679f7d7122b0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f6459061813b90925eb4cc8568792848f263b352b20f3a54947387569c122a2.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"遠野 由佳","creatorId":"vndb:s2065","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2065","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2065","name":"遠野 由佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1446","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3936","characterName":"篠塚 美鈴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3936"},"originalCharacterName":"篠塚 美鈴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"This \"Ice Queen\" has quite the attitude. She's haughty and demanding, acting put upon even having to interact with Kazuma. In reality, this behavior is a mechanism to hide parts of herself that she finds embarassing. Once she's put in a compromising position, though, they're bared for all to see."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3936"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23599842b6fca9aeaac8eb9bd1367fa1c2b91520b07d2cc207dd5955926f1893.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37443b351c792a50d1889be6b5e15dfd9c36e092f163416e1d71df80ed00b52f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3937","characterName":"姫野宮 詩織","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3937"},"originalCharacterName":"姫野宮 詩織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"What an outrageous personality. Shiori has been sheltered by her rich parents all her life, so she acts very childish and innocent. However, this absence of shame means she doesn't hesitate to speak openly about her favorite hobby: masturbation. She's looking forward to expanding her sexual horizons with the new guy in town..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3937"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/629fa0f17872abe2f68d5a814ff3f772f703eed483918ddff39f594cb6ecbda4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/82c29400fc13f89e1c4ec48fcbbe4a87803eee9645faf8bc88dfd4f792c66aee.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59928","characterName":"藤沢 縁","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59928"},"originalCharacterName":"藤沢 縁","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Cursed with a small build and cute face, the high school senior has often been mistaken for a girl throughout his life. However, this supposed weakness is about to become his ticket into paradise. Looking for something to do in his spare time, Yukari applies for a job at Platinum, an exclusive Italian eatery. Even though the opening is really for women, his irresistable cuteness lands him the post. He hasn't been able to land himself a girlfriend yet, but hopefully that will change at Platinum!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59928"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/118dc6161b373d48fc07c44e3f3533d9073c6103f0c58ca70b573d7c5ca698ac.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2ac31182255e2fba3ebbcce41549bc886b36600878815d3ab9ad283689c3d429.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60294","characterName":"高槻 和馬","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60294"},"originalCharacterName":"高槻 和馬","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dumped by his college girlfriend, Kazuma left the country, ending up in Europe studying about wine. Now, after a few years of work, he's a damn fine sommelier, and has a comfy job at an exclusive Italian restaurant."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, his world is about to be turned upside-down again. His old flame appears out of the blue, taking them both by surprise. She's just become the manager of a new restaurant, \"Platinum: Oceanside\", and she offers him the opportunity to come work for her. Even though she's married now, Kazuma can't resist her charms, so back to Japan he goes!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Always cool and collected, Kazuma doesn't have a problem being the heart-throb of the new Platinum, and he's ready to have fun with all the girls. But even though his old relationships have ended because he wasn't serious enough, he has grown-up in his time in Europe. Kazuma genuinely wants to find love, and he couldn't be looking for it in a better place."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb"